---
source: src/cli/tests.rs
expression: "long_help(|c| c.find_subcommand_mut(\"hf-cache\"))"
---
Populate the HuggingFace hub cache for offline serving (vLLM, transformers)

Usage: hf-cache <COMMAND>

Commands:
  sync  Populate the real HuggingFace hub cache (~/.cache/huggingface/hub) so vLLM/transformers/`hf download` find a revision-pinned snapshot with zero network calls
  path  Print the snapshot path for a model/revision (refs/ lookup with an online fallback; scripting helper)
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
